<![CDATA[<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></span><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hope all is well and your week is off to a great start!&nbsp; I wanted to follow up on your turnkey real estate investing interests to see if you had any questions for me or the Memphis Invest Portfolio Advisor team.&nbsp; Would love to schedule a call at your convenience to answer any questions you may have!&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thanks and look forward to hearing from you soon!</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><img src="https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Yw3vz8sampQEMHmb17PfpxdpNSvoBXKwt7W8NZX3sPuDLddPquzaEsjEBOgHbkddyPTwunJGZLXgaInqviAVrUMj3ROq_m5xHnNKQFRQiNosUDevQHZ3pbEf5-efKOPI54zmv7g4o5gdz4e5XoekqcN-_YVFDJjigMNFqii2w6rS0rPSFCn76O-ZTluV61fTAWSJ9V-auSO2ZfZUY9wHF29xdy6qQOMXQ6zLB01pvD4U4kP4=s0-d-e1-ft#https://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hubfs/Screen%20Shot%202019-03-18%20at%208.53.25%20AM.png?width=1014&amp;name=Screen%20Shot%202019-03-18%20at%208.53.25%20AM.png" width="420" height="172" class="CToWUd"></div>]]></td>
